            <title>[LU-21082] PCC-RO: add 'mount.lustre -o pcc=$cachedir' option </title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21082</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Add an option like &lt;tt&gt;pcc=CACHEDIR&lt;/tt&gt; to &lt;tt&gt;mount.lustre&lt;/tt&gt; to automatically configure and enable PCC-RO on a client mountpoint.  This would depend on an in-tree PCC cache management utility that &lt;tt&gt;mount.lustre&lt;/tt&gt; would start, but would simplify usage and configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
